    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29390" root="عصو" body-key="E">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعتصى عَلَى العَصَا</span></b>  <i>He leaned,</i> or <i>he supported,</i>
or <i>stayed, himself, upon the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصَا</span> [or <i>staff,</i> &amp;c.].
(S, Mgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَعْتَصِى بِالسَّيْفِ</span> He <i>makes use
of the sword as a staff.</i> (S, and TA in this art.
and in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عصى</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعتصى الشَّجَرَةَ</span> <i>He cut
a staff,</i> or <i>stick,</i> or <i>rod,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصًا</span>,) <i>from the
tree.</i> (K.)

